  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There seems to be a trend of people crashing people's games, and as soon as an unknown user joined, I was greeted with blaring music and a frozen game. VRChat crashed because of user activity. I have an opaque understanding of why this is, and I'd like to know how you're going to address this issue, as many of our community have had an experience alike to my own. This is a recurring issue and it takes the enjoyment out of VRChat, whereas I've had experiences where I'm mid-conversation and someone joins only to crash someone. This brings me to another important subject, I'm only new to the community (as of two days prior to this post) and it's starting to leave me thinking if VRChat is worth my time. \n\nThank you for reading.",
